  "description": "Adds a political map layer to the sector and intel screens, displaying faction territories, alliances, and claims. Includes a collapsible sidebar for controlling map views and filters. Compatible with Fast Rendering, Nexerelin, and Random Assortment of Things.",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Adds a political map layer to the sector and intel screens, displaying faction territories, alliances, and claims. Includes a collapsible sidebar for controlling map views and filters. Compatible with Fast Rendering, Nexerelin, and Random Assortment of Things.</p>",
