  "discordPostHtml": "<p>Currently in pre-release. Requires <strong>LazyLib</strong> and <strong>LunaLib</strong>. Safe to enable mid-save, uninstalled via settings.</p><p>Install it via <a href=\"https://trilink.wispborne.com/open.html?mod=%7B&quot;url&quot;%3A&quot;https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FKlark-Morrigan%2FStarsector-Mod-KMU%2Freleases%2Flatest%2Fdownload%2Fkmu-en.version&quot;%2C&quot;id&quot;%3A&quot;kmu&quot;%7D&amp;dep=%7B&quot;url&quot;%3A&quot;https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FLazyWizard%2Flazylib%2Fmaster%2Fmod%2Flazylib.version&quot;%2C&quot;id&quot;%3A&quot;lw_lazylib&quot;%7D&amp;dep=%7B&quot;url&quot;%3A&quot;https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FLukas22041%2FLunaLib%2Fmain%2FLunaLib.version&quot;%2C&quot;id&quot;%3A&quot;lunalib&quot;%7D&amp;dep=%7B&quot;url&quot;%3A&quot;https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FKlark-Morrigan%2FStarsector-Mod-KMLib%2Freleases%2Flatest%2Fdownload%2Fkmlib-en.version&quot;%2C&quot;id&quot;%3A&quot;kmlib&quot;%7D\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>TriOS</strong></a> or by downloading <a href=\"https://github.com/Klark-Morrigan/Starsector-Mod-KMLib/releases/latest\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>KMLib</strong></a> (its dependency) and <a href=\"https://github.com/Klark-Morrigan/Starsector-Mod-KMU/releases/latest\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>KMU</strong></a> (the mod itself).</p><p>The <strong>Political Map</strong> is the first among <strong>Sector Map Layers</strong> and focuses on populated colonies and their allegiances, with <strong>Faction</strong>, <strong>Alliance</strong>, and <strong>Claim</strong> views. It shows up primarily on the map screen and the intel screen, with a collapsible sidebar as its control interface.</p><p>Made compatible with <strong>Fast Rendering</strong>, <strong>Nexerelin</strong> (alliances), <strong>Random Assortment of Things</strong> (minimap replacement). Can <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mA9gAeQeEhA\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">play <strong>Bad Apple</strong></a>.</p><p><strong>Bishop1664</strong> made a short <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3BoDbbFrMPo\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">video showcase</a>.</p><p>Discuss in <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/187635036525166592/1549091275167240272\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.com/channels/187635036525166592/1549091275167240272</a><br>Forum thread: <a href=\"https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=36029.0\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=36029.0</a></p>",
